      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Yeah, whatever. I risk my neck out for them and it takes them forever to return the favor. Anyway, that's not your fault. You're probably just some random fool who got mixed up with them.\n\nI'm sure you've seen the Cairnmogs out here in the valley, right?",
