      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "That's about the size of it. I can't do my duties at Czerka if I'm constantly concerned for their well-being. Go take them down and let me know when you're done.",
